20:16.600 --> 20:17.760
Awak memang gila.

20:17.840 --> 20:18.750
Kenapa awak nak kacau dia?

20:18.750 --> 20:19.550
Saya mana ada kacau dia?

20:19.630 --> 20:21.660
Kalau awak tak kacau, mungkinkah dia pukul awak?

20:21.700 --> 20:22.880
